 ionary Computation & Optimization\, Machine Learning\, Explainability & I
 nterpretability\nSize: S\nSubmission type: Paper-based / Springer LNCS\nC
 onfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Official EvoS
 tar pages confirm Mainz\, March 31-April 2\, in hybrid mode. Published de
 adline days have no exact cutoff hour or timezone\; AoE timestamps are pr
 ovisional and calendars use all-day events. The shared EvoStar late-break
 ing-abstract date is not yet a verified EuroGP-specific paper route. S is
  an editorial size estimate for EuroGP\, not the whole EvoStar event.\nSc
 ope: Genetic programming and evolutionary program synthesis\, including s
 ymbolic regression\, program representations and operators\, surrogate-as
